# Constitutional ship-lane files — changes require code-owner review (ADR 0088/0090/0091).
#
# GitHub blocks a PR author from approving their own PR, so requiring a
# code-owner review on these paths means the autonomous staging-self-ship loop
# (the PR author) physically cannot self-produce the approval signal. This is
# the trusted-signal replacement for the author-writable `[constitutional-change-ack]`
# PR-body marker (superseded — ADR 0091).
#
# This list MUST stay in sync with PROTECTED_PATHS in
# scripts/check_constitutional_review.py (tests/test_constitutional_review.py
# asserts parity so the two cannot drift).
/scripts/_staging_ship.py        @hskim-solv
/scripts/_ship_env.py            @hskim-solv
/scripts/_ship_payload_guard.py  @hskim-solv
/scripts/_governance.py          @hskim-solv
/.github/workflows/staging-self-ship-guard.yml @hskim-solv
/.github/CODEOWNERS              @hskim-solv
/.githooks/pre-commit           @hskim-solv
